            "review_title": "Review at Pizza Lovers Cơ Sở 3",
            "review_text": "Vanesa Jarana\nLeon, Spain2055 contributions\n0\nPIZZA LOVERS AND MORE\nMar 2025\nHow wonderful to have this place next to our hotel, Chalcedony Hotel. \nThe place is small but has an extensive menu with salads, burgers, pizzas, pasta, toast, nachos, potatoes,... \nService is fast and pizzas are exquisite. Of all the other things I can't say because we have pizza both days. We are real pizza lovers:)\nExceptional value for money. Quite a hit when you want to vary from local food.\nRead more\nTranslated from Spanish\nShow original\nWritten August 14, 2025",
